  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hyaluronic Acid</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A liquid highlighter that immediately hydrates to visibly lift and firm the appearance of cheeks, delivering up to 12 hours of buildable, radiant glow.<br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Liquid<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Upcycled White Lupin Seed Extract: Visibly firms skin for a smooth look.<br>- Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts water to plump skin with hydration.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, phthalates, mineral oil, and triclosan. It is also vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Infused with the Unreal Lifting Complex, this serum-like textured highlighter immediately hydrates, lifts, and firms for all-day, smoother-looking cheeks. The weightless texture blends seamlessly into the skin</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Before using, shake thoroughly and tap the bottle firmly against your palm with the cap on.<br>-Remove cap and gently press the soft button to dispense one to two drops on the back of the hand.<br>-Use No. 16 Highlighter Brush (sold separately) to pick up a small amount of product using a stippling motion.<br>-Lightly tap the brush starting at the apple of the cheek, then buff and blend upward toward the cheekbone.<br>-For additional glow, apply it on inner arch of your brow bone, Cupid&rsquo;s bow, and bridge of the nose.<br>-Easily blend with foundation for an all-over glow or layer with Unreal Liquid Blush (sold separately) for a full Unreal look.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Upcycled White Lupin Seed Extract: Visibly firms skin for a smooth look.<br>-Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts water to plump skin with hydration.<br><br>Water/Aqua/Eau, Butylene Glycol, 2,3-Butanediol, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Mica, Glycerin, Silica, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Cetearyl Olivate, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sorbitan Olivate, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-6, Caprylyl Glycol, Dimethicone, Ethylhexylglycerin, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Polyacrylate-13, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Lupinus Albus Seed Extract, Xanthan Gum, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Tin Oxide, Sorbitan Isostearate, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Tocopherol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Caproic Acid, Iron Oxides (Ci 77491), Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hyaluronic Acid</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A liquid highlighter that immediately hydrates to visibly lift and firm the appearance of cheeks, delivering up to 12 hours of buildable, radiant glow.<br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Liquid<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Upcycled White Lupin Seed Extract: Visibly firms skin for a smooth look.<br>- Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts water to plump skin with hydration.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, phthalates, mineral oil, and triclosan. It is also vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Infused with the Unreal Lifting Complex, this serum-like textured highlighter immediately hydrates, lifts, and firms for all-day, smoother-looking cheeks. The weightless texture blends seamlessly into the skin</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Before using, shake thoroughly and tap the bottle firmly against your palm with the cap on.<br>-Remove cap and gently press the soft button to dispense one to two drops on the back of the hand.<br>-Use No. 16 Highlighter Brush (sold separately) to pick up a small amount of product using a stippling motion.<br>-Lightly tap the brush starting at the apple of the cheek, then buff and blend upward toward the cheekbone.<br>-For additional glow, apply it on inner arch of your brow bone, Cupid&rsquo;s bow, and bridge of the nose.<br>-Easily blend with foundation for an all-over glow or layer with Unreal Liquid Blush (sold separately) for a full Unreal look.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Upcycled White Lupin Seed Extract: Visibly firms skin for a smooth look.<br>-Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts water to plump skin with hydration.<br><br>Water/Aqua/Eau, Butylene Glycol, 2,3-Butanediol, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Mica, Glycerin, Silica, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Cetearyl Olivate, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sorbitan Olivate, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-6, Caprylyl Glycol, Dimethicone, Ethylhexylglycerin, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Polyacrylate-13, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Lupinus Albus Seed Extract, Xanthan Gum, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Tin Oxide, Sorbitan Isostearate, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Tocopherol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Caproic Acid, Iron Oxides (Ci 77491), Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891).</div></details>",
